{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/63277cd6c680698ed784ebf03dc842a5.avif?t=1773383134\" width=900 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into a lighthearted world of fishing, where every cast brings new surprises. In <i>Chu-Bang</i>, <strong>relax fishing exploration blends with playful deck-building battles</strong> in a charming mix of cozy and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your dream deck of fish, compete in fun tournaments, and rise through the ranks to prove you\u2019re the best fisher in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/e42adf842a4a614e225c68e27bf78deb.avif?t=1773383134\" width=1080 height=549 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/eb221de1281a784ba24a8e4aa6ef64ba.avif?t=1773383134\" width=900 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore shimmering ponds and hidden lakes, each home to unique fish species. Cast your line, discover rare catches, and fill your catalog with all kinds of aquatic wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/5cdc716ca1f0d8fecfabbfab8c790bd5.poster.avif?t=1773383134\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/5cdc716ca1f0d8fecfabbfab8c790bd5.webm?t=1773383134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/5cdc716ca1f0d8fecfabbfab8c790bd5.mp4?t=1773383134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/ce23f4e891a51fc1f74f7970a32c244a.avif?t=1773383134\" width=900 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn your catches into powerful cards! Build the ultimate fish deck and challenge quirky rivals in friendly, fast-paced battles that blend fun and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/0d9d0da3dcc91d124511eb626c213f58.poster.avif?t=1773383134\" width=780 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/0d9d0da3dcc91d124511eb626c213f58.webm?t=1773383134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/0d9d0da3dcc91d124511eb626c213f58.mp4?t=1773383134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/d58ef4dec35d89ee29c7551d7e28c634.avif?t=1773383134\" width=900 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From peaceful fishing spots to mysterious waters, every location offers surprises, new fish to catch, and rivals to overcome. Adventure at your own pace in the cozy world of <i>Chu-Bang</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973330/extras/0f08d2841d3243784c1afae8